# Civil Engineering: Improving the Quality of Life.

**Authors:** One Feather, Sandra

## Abstract
American Indian civil engineers describe the educational paths that led them to their engineering careers, applications of civil engineering in reservation communities, necessary job skills, opportunities afforded by internship programs, continuing education, and the importance of early preparation in math and science. Addresses of 12 resource Web sites are included. (SV)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ658059

